{"id":"decef5fed3c2d53d","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-kolm.md","title":"前缀 Kolmogorov 复杂度","display":"df-kolm — 前缀 Kolmogorov 复杂度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-kolm","aliases":["20-df-kolm"],"display":"df-kolm — 前缀 Kolmogorov 复杂度","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.randomness","source_kind":"local-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"旧条目的本地规范化；书外概念","depends_on":["[[20-df-prefix-free-machine]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-kolm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-kolm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kolm — 前缀 Kolmogorov 复杂度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.randomness"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"旧条目的本地规范化；书外概念"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b14b710944eb2928\" href=\"?note=b14b710944eb2928\" title=\"20-df-prefix-free-machine\">20-df-prefix-free-machine</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是固定最优前缀自由机器；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(x\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b14b710944eb2928\" href=\"?note=b14b710944eb2928\" title=\"20-df-prefix-free-machine\">20-df-prefix-free-machine</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kolm}\\vdash\n\\mathrm K_U(x):=\\min\\{|p|:U(p)\\downarrow=x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kolm}\\vdash\n\\mathrm K_U(x):=\\min\\{|p|:U(p)\\downarrow=x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>改用带 U 下标的正体复杂度记号，避免与停机集 K 混淆。原稿只要求机器前缀自由而没有最优性，不能支持机器独立的复杂度概念；已补全必要条件。复杂度理论及随机性的 Levin–Schnorr 表征未在本轮冒充原书定理加入。</p>\n<p>来源：旧条目的本地规范化；书外概念。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-prefix-free-machine","status":"resolved","id":"b14b710944eb2928","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-prefix-free-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-prefix-free-machine","status":"resolved","id":"b14b710944eb2928","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-prefix-free-machine]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kolm}\\vdash\n\\mathrm K_U(x):=\\min\\{|p|:U(p)\\downarrow=x\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1072,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-469","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-kolm]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-469","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-kolm]]"}],"outgoing":["b14b710944eb2928"]}